Main.CopySrc = [=====[
--[[
	UI Copier 2.1 by DuaKNo
	Executor script (Delta, Solara, Wave, Xeno, Fluxus...). Client side only.

	TABS
	Pick   click any UI on screen, see its layers / children / roots, details (text is selectable)
	Props  detail viewer + live editor for every property (Rows or Raw view, filter, undo)
	Find   text finder across all UI (by text / name / class / image), replace all, copy list
	Code   generated code in an editor: find, replace, select, edit, run, save
	Saved  saves as light JSON files (index + one small file per save), load / spawn / rename / export / import
	Tools  multi pick, tree, drag/resize, compare, plain Lua export, auto reload, remap assets, events dump, find copies, recolor, preview
	Set    themes, accent color, text size, font, roundness, opacity, panel size, copy options

	- "-" in the title bar shrinks the panel to a small square. Tap the square to open it again (RightShift too).
	- "Tap" in the title bar starts click mode from any tab.
	- Closing asks "Do you want to close this GUI?".

	Scripts and events are not copied, only the look (properties and children).
	ViewportFrame 3D content and custom asset files cannot be copied.
]]

local L = {}
